---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
import CtaButton from "../components/CtaButton.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Corporate Solutions"
  description="Custom AI consulting and training engagements designed to transform how your organization works with AI."
>
  <Section>
    <div class="corporate-hero">
      <div class="corporate-hero__copy">
        <h2 class="section__title">Corporate Solutions</h2>
        <img class="inline-photo" src="/assets/services/corporate-solutions.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" />
        <p>Custom AI training and consulting designed to transform how your organization works with AI.</p>
        <CtaButton href="/contact" variant="primary">Schedule a Discovery Call</CtaButton>
      </div>
      <div class="card corporate-hero__highlight">
        <h3>Why Organizations Choose Us</h3>
        <ul class="checklist">
          <li><span class="checklist__icon" aria-hidden="true">✅</span> Content updates as fast as AI evolves</li>
          <li><span class="checklist__icon" aria-hidden="true">✅</span> Practitioners who deploy AI daily</li>
          <li><span class="checklist__icon" aria-hidden="true">✅</span> Hands-on, applied learning</li>
          <li><span class="checklist__icon" aria-hidden="true">✅</span> Flexible delivery (on-site or virtual)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section title="What We Offer">
    <p>Comprehensive engagements to meet your organization where you are in your AI journey.</p>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="card">
        <span class="icon-badge" aria-hidden="true">🏢</span>
        <h3>Custom Workshops</h3>
        <p>Tailored training sessions designed for your specific team, industry, and challenges.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>On-site or virtual delivery</li>
          <li>Teams of 10-100+ participants</li>
          <li>Industry-specific examples and use cases</li>
          <li>Custom program development</li>
          <li>Follow-up resources and support</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="icon-badge" aria-hidden="true">📚</span>
        <h3>Custom Content</h3>
        <p>Bespoke AI training materials and documentation for your organization.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Branded training materials</li>
          <li>Internal AI playbooks</li>
          <li>Process documentation</li>
          <li>Video content creation</li>
          <li>Ongoing content updates</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="icon-badge" aria-hidden="true">🎯</span>
        <h3>Consulting</h3>
        <p>Strategic AI guidance to help your organization navigate adoption.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>AI readiness assessment</li>
          <li>Implementation roadmaps</li>
          <li>Tool selection guidance</li>
          <li>Change management support</li>
          <li>ROI measurement frameworks</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="icon-badge" aria-hidden="true">🧑‍🏫</span>
        <h3>Work With Our Experts</h3>
        <p>Direct access to our team of AI practitioners for your toughest challenges.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Embedded expert support</li>
          <li>Technical mentorship</li>
          <li>Project-based engagements</li>
          <li>Executive coaching</li>
          <li>Team upskilling programs</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section title="How It Works" alt>
    <p>A proven methodology for transforming your team's AI capabilities.</p>
    <div class="stepper">
      <div class="stepper__step">
        <span class="step-badge">1</span>
        <h3>Discovery Call</h3>
        <p>Free 30-minute consultation to understand your team's needs and goals.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stepper__step">
        <span class="step-badge">2</span>
        <h3>Custom Design</h3>
        <p>We design a program tailored to your industry, team size, and objectives.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stepper__step">
        <span class="step-badge">3</span>
        <h3>Delivery</h3>
        <p>Your team learns together, builds together, and levels up together.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stepper__step">
        <span class="step-badge">4</span>
        <h3>Ongoing Success</h3>
        <p>Implementation guides and follow-up resources ensure lasting adoption.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section title="Who We Work With">
    <p>Organizations across industries are transforming with AI.</p>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="card"><h3>Executive Teams</h3><p>AI strategy development, vendor evaluation, and leadership alignment on AI initiatives.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Marketing &amp; Creative</h3><p>Content generation, visual AI tools, and creative workflow automation.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Sales Teams</h3><p>Prospecting automation, personalization at scale, and AI-powered CRM workflows.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Operations</h3><p>Process automation, document analysis, and operational efficiency gains.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Technical Teams</h3><p>AI-assisted development, code review automation, and agentic workflows.</p></div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section title="Book a Discovery Call" class="cta-banner">
    <p>Let's discuss how we can help your organization stay ahead of the AI curve.</p>
    <CtaButton href="/contact" variant="primary">Schedule a Discovery Call</CtaButton>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>
